    "message": "feat(admin): give the Limits settings a page to live on\n\n4.50.0 registered a limits section and 18 fields, but no view claimed it, so\nthe fields existed in the API and rendered nowhere. Verified against a real\nserver this time rather than the manifest: the nav now lists Limits between Web\nSearch and Guide, and its container renders the section.\n\nIt claims 'diagnostics' too, which no view claimed either, so logging flags stop\nfalling through to a leftover bucket.\n\nOrdered by what a value costs -- live requests, then disk, then noise -- rather\nthan by the subsystem that happens to read it.\n\nMINOR: new admin view.",
